rd traps) warrant audit","Logo/brand mark wasn’t surfaced in extracted data; ensure persistent, accessible brand signifier and alt text across headers","Location-detection prompts and overlays can stack with cookie notices, creating friction in the first session","Color tokens appear inconsistent (multiple similar blues/teals); token drift can reduce consistency at scale"],"designElements":{"colorPalette":["#000000","#FFFFFF","#1151FF","#1790C8","#51ACC7","#003344","#FED533","#F36B26","#F0728F","#8D429F","#E7352B","#808080","#7BBA3C","#825D41","#FFF8A3"],"typography":["'Helvetica Neue'","Helvetica","Arial","sans-serif","Neue Frutiger Arabic"],"visualStyle":"Product-first, minimalist, high-contrast layouts with generous whitespace; modular cards and grid system; bold photography and clean CTAs consistent with Nike’s modern retail aesthetic"},"brandVoice":{"tone":"Confident, minimal, performance-forward, and transactional with a focus on getting to purchase","personality":["Bold","Innovative","Athletic","Aspirational","Urban","Inclusive"],"messagingThemes":["Performance innovation (Air/VaporMax technology)","Style and lifestyle versatility","Guidance and education (buying guides, care, styling)","Personalization and membership benefits","Data/privacy transparency"]},"industry":"Athletic footwear and apparel (sportswear e-commerce)","targetAudience":"Global athletes and style-conscious consumers, ages ~16–45; sneaker enthusiasts, runners, training and gym users, and urban lifestyle shoppers with mid-to-premium spend","needsOverhaul":false,"recommendations":["Performance: Defer and split non-critical JS, limit third-party tags, adopt server-side rendering for core PDP content, and target LCP < 2.5s, CLS < 0.1, TTI < 3.5s on mid-tier mobile devices","Consent UX: Collapse advanced options by default and add a single prominent 'Accept necessary and continue' path to reduce entry friction while preserving transparency","Visual hierarchy: Rationalize accent colors via a tighter token set (primary, secondary, status) and document usage to prevent palette drift across PDP variations","Accessibility: Increase contrast on light grays, ensure visible focus states, audit alt text on all imagery, and test keyboard-only flows for modals and consent dialogs","Storytelling: Add a concise benefit-driven intro (innovation, comfort, durability) and a quick-fit guide (e.g., 'runs small/true/large') above the fold to cut decision friction","Social proof: Surface key review snippets, fit distribution charts, and UGC looks near the size selector to support conversion without scrolling","Content depth: Include sustainability/materials info, care highlights, and a short 'why we made this' to align with values-based shoppers","Findability: Strengthen internal linking from the PDP to relevant Buying Guides and Product Care pages; ensure breadcrumb clarity and robust search facets","Commerce UI: Keep price and primary CTA sticky on mobile; clarify shipping/returns next to CTA; provide 'Find in Store' and clear delivery ETA early","Media enhancements: Add a 360° product view or short looped videos demonstrating cushioning/flex; consider lightweight AR sizing where supported","Global UX: Make country/language switcher persistently discoverable; avoid stacking geo and cookie overlays; remember user choice gracefully","Design ops: Codify typography, spacing, and color tokens in a shared library; run cross-device QA to align visual parity and reduce regressions","Analytics: Implement event taxonomy for size selection, variant views, and media interactions; pair with experimentation to test copy and imagery above the fold","SEO: Ensure product schema, rich results (price, availability, reviews), clean canonicalization, and server-rendered critical content for reliable indexing"]},"competitorAnalysis":{"competitors":[{"name":"adidas (Ultraboost, 4DFWD, NMD)","website":"https://www.adidas.com","strengths":["Global brand equity and distribution","Proven cushioning t