rif"},"visualStyle":"Tactile minimalism: luminous off-white grounds, deep graphite type, and generous negative space that frames product craft. Product-first compositions are enriched with subtle texture cues (natural fabric grain, soft shadows), editorial grids, and proof-forward interface elements (impact badges, origin maps). Motion is precise and understated—micro-transitions that imply quality. Photography balances clean studio precision with lived-in lifestyle vignettes for warmth and humanity.","mood":["quietly confident","considered","refined","human","transparent","sustainable-by-design"],"designPrinciples":["Proof-first transparency: impact labels, origin maps, and scannable product passports embedded on PDPs","Accessible by default: AA/AAA contrast, minimum 16px body, clear focus states, semantic markup and alt text","Performance-led minimalism: variable fonts, reduced scripts, optimized media to minimize CLS/FCP","Systemic consistency: clean token taxonomy and naming; unified capitalization and navigation language","Inclusive presence: multi-model, multi-size, adaptive imagery for every SKU","Circularity in-frame: repair, resale, and take-back surfaced at point of consideration","Global clarity: localized pricing/duties and geo-aware messaging without visual noise","Editorial restraint: neutral palette dominance; accents only for interaction and verified impact"]},"campaignConcepts":[{"name":"Proof, Not Promises","description":"A transparency-first platform that turns every product into a story you can scan—digital passports (QR/NFC) reveal farm-to-factory traceability, verified living-wage data, and standardized impact labels on water, CO2e, and chemicals.","targetAudience":"Eco-conscious professionals who demand verified sustainability over marketing claims","keyMessage":"Transparency you can wear.","visualDirection":"Macro material textures paired with clean UI overlays (impact badges in Pine), origin route maps, and subtle QR/NFC motifs. Hero the Essential Organic Crew (AUTO_10) with a passport reveal sequence and cost-per-wear calculator."},{"name":"The Capsule That Works","description":"A data-driven capsule configurator that builds week-to-week outfits from a minimal set of pieces—surfacing cost-per-wear, impact, and versatility. Anchored in All Clothing (AUTO_1) to demonstrate breadth without clutter.","targetAudience":"Time-poor minimalists seeking fewer, better pieces that solve daily dressing","keyMessage":"Own less. Do more.","visualDirection":"Editorial grids and modular outfit stacks on Bone, product floating with soft shadows. Accents in Cobalt only for actions. Multi-model try-ons show fits across sizes, with an on-hover transparency panel."},{"name":"Modern Workleisure | Men’s Edit","description":"An elevated men’s essentials story expanding beyond tees—performance chinos, tech-linen shirts, travel-ready knits—built for commute-to-dinner versatility within men’s clothing (AUTO_5).","targetAudience":"Urban men 25–45 who want comfort-performance without compromising polish","keyMessage":"Ease meets intention.","visualDirection":"Cinematic movement studies: walking, cycling, commuting. Clean architectural backdrops, text overlays that call out low-tox finishes and easy care. Feature the Essential Organic Crew (AUTO_10) layered."},{"name":"Every Body, Every Day","description":"A brand-world statement on inclusivity and function—extended sizing, petite/tall, and adaptive options shown consistently for every SKU.","targetAudience":"Size-inclusive and adaptive shoppers who expect parity in style, quality, and storytelling","keyMessage":"One standard: great design for all bodies.","visualDirection":"Consistent multi-model PDP tiles, clean studio light with seated/standing poses to demonstrate adaptive features. Pine-green micro-badges call out adaptive/fit notes; Cobalt reserved for interactions."},{"name":"Local Edit","description":"Regionally produced quick-turn capsules that lower transport emissions an