885365ff266","productName":"AIR JORDAN 11 RETRO RA","format":"product-ad","concept":"Fit Passport","imagePath":"generated-creatives/a8025d5d_5bb4_5db7_a204_2885365ff266_product-ad_v0_1762269340819.png","prompt":"You are given a reference photo of the garment. Use the garment exactly as shown. Do NOT redesign, recolor, or change the silhouette, embellishments, trims, or construction details. Maintain full fidelity to the reference image and only adapt lighting, camera work, set design, and supporting elements.

Scene inspiration (from Behance): Minimal, premium overhead product hero of a neatly folded athletic tee with repeat gold grid/star jersey pattern and black collar, centered on a soft light-gray seamless. Soft directional light from top-left, clean drop shadow to right, full sharpness. Tone: modern, performance-luxe for global male sneaker/athlete audience. Keep negative space for localization and color swaps.
Camera: Top-down 90° overhead on tripod. Full-frame 50–70mm to minimize distortion; distance ~0.8–1.2 m to frame shirt with 10–15% margin. Aperture f/8–f/11 for edge-to-edge sharpness; ISO 100; 1/125s sync. Sensor parallel to surface; enable gridlines and use a bubble level. Capture a plate of the empty background for compositing if needed.
Lighting: Large soft key from top-left (3x4 ft softbox or 120 cm octa) ~45° off axis, ~1 m above product for broad, even wraps and gentle speculars on the print. Right-side fill via white foam board to lift shadows by ~0.5–1 stop; add subtle negative fill (black card) on far left to keep shape. Background light feathered to create a faint left-to-right gradient. Optional polarizing filter to tame glare on the pattern.
Foreground: No additional elements. Elevate the shirt 1–2 cm on a hidden foam sheet to create a clean, soft-edged drop shadow.
Midground: Hero: a precisely folded jersey/tee, collar facing up and slightly above center. Symmetrical folds; maintain visible collar bowl with inner black rib peeking. Align the repeat pattern vertically and horizontally so gridlines run parallel to frame edges. Add a mild fabric roll at the hem for volume.
Background: Matte seamless paper or acrylic in very light gray (#ECECEC–#F2F2F2) to keep whites clean while preserving product edge contrast. Keep it spotless and uniform with a soft gradient bias to the right.
Props: Garment board for crisp fold; fabric steamer; museum putty/t-pins to hold corners; thin foam riser; lint roller. No logos or extra objects to preserve the minimal, premium look.
Post-processing: Perspective/keystone correction to perfect 90° lines. Clean dust/threads; liquify for micro fold refinement. Global WB to neutral cool (6500–6800K). Subtle contrast via S-curve; lift blacks slightly for a soft-matte finish. Sharpen fabric micro-texture; reduce noise in background. Hue/Sat: protect whites, gently boost gold/orange by +10–15% saturation. Paint a soft right-side drop shadow if needed; maintain highlight detail on print.
Emotion: Clean, confident, modern performance-luxe—signal precision, quality, and sneaker-culture minimalism.

