e shirt 1–2 cm on a hidden foam sheet to create a clean, soft-edged drop shadow.","midground":"Hero: a precisely folded jersey/tee, collar facing up and slightly above center. Symmetrical folds; maintain visible collar bowl with inner black rib peeking. Align the repeat pattern vertically and horizontally so gridlines run parallel to frame edges. Add a mild fabric roll at the hem for volume.","background":"Matte seamless paper or acrylic in very light gray (#ECECEC–#F2F2F2) to keep whites clean while preserving product edge contrast. Keep it spotless and uniform with a soft gradient bias to the right.","props":"Garment board for crisp fold; fabric steamer; museum putty/t-pins to hold corners; thin foam riser; lint roller. No logos or extra objects to preserve the minimal, premium look.","postProcessing":"Perspective/keystone correction to perfect 90° lines. Clean dust/threads; liquify for micro fold refinement. Global WB to neutral cool (6500–6800K). Subtle contrast via S-curve; lift blacks slightly for a soft-matte finish. Sharpen fabric micro-texture; reduce noise in background. Hue/Sat: protect whites, gently boost gold/orange by +10–15% saturation. Paint a soft right-side drop shadow if needed; maintain highlight detail on print.","emotion":"Clean, confident, modern performance-luxe—signal precision, quality, and sneaker-culture minimalism."}},{"id":"Behance-ef3c3ad1c527","imageUrl":"https://mir-s3-cdn-cf.behance.net/project_modules/fs_webp/240735142032831.625f523fc243c.jpg","localImagePath":"/Users/gaganarora/Desktop/projects/motiacreative-development/reference-cache/images/ef3c3ad1c527b10ed151431f1782278a14ff1146.webp","headline":"Salehe Bembury x New Balance 574 Yurt","description":"Award-winning FOOTWEAR project from Behance","source":{"sourceName":"Behance","sourceUrl":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/142032831/Salehe-Bembury-x-New-Balance-574-Yurt?tracking_source=search_projects|FOOTWEAR+product+photography&l=0","publishedAt":"2025","awards":["500+ Behance Appreciations"]},"promptSummary":"","sceneComposition":{"camera":"Not specified","lighting":"Not specified","foreground":"Not specified","midground":"Not specified","background":"Not specified","props":"Not specified","postProcessing":"Not specified","emotion":"Not specified"}},{"id":"Behance-ef3c3ad1c527","imageUrl":"https://mir-s3-cdn-cf.behance.net/project_modules/fs_webp/240735142032831.625f523fc243c.jpg","localImagePath":"/Users/gaganarora/Desktop/projects/motiacreative-development/reference-cache/images/ef3c3ad1c527b10ed151431f1782278a14ff1146.webp","headline":"Salehe Bembury x New Balance 574 Yurt","description":"Award-winning FOOTWEAR project from Behance","source":{"sourceName":"Behance","sourceUrl":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/142032831/Salehe-Bembury-x-New-Balance-574-Yurt?tracking_source=search_projects%7CFOOTWEAR+product+photography","publishedAt":"2025","awards":["500+ Behance Appreciations"]},"promptSummary":"","sceneComposition":{"camera":"Not specified","lighting":"Not specified","foreground":"Not specified","midground":"Not specified","background":"Not specified","props":"Not specified","postProcessing":"Not specified","emotion":"Not specified"}},{"id":"Behance-4ca3d9ee04fc","imageUrl":"https://mir-s3-cdn-cf.behance.net/project_modules/max_3840_webp/a5f61d194318529.65fa2a44aa603.jpg","localImagePath":"/Users/gaganarora/Desktop/projects/motiacreative-development/reference-cache/images/4ca3d9ee04fc0e38423b2e5e730d7ff508313347.webp","headline":"Sneaker Photo Composites (Jan-Mar 2024)","description":"Award-winning FOOTWEAR project from Behance","source":{"sourceName":"Behance","sourceUrl":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/194318529/Sneaker-Photo-Composites-(Jan-Mar-2024)?tracking_source=search_projects|FOOTWEAR+product+photography&l=1","publishedAt":"2025","awards":["500+ Behance Appreciations"]},"promptSummary":"","sceneComposition":{"camera":"Not specified","lighting":"Not specified","foreground":"Not specified","midground":"Not specified","background":"Not specified","props":"Not specified","postProcessing":"Not specified","emotion":"Not specified"}},{"id":"Behance-dcac487da125","imageUrl":"https://mir-s3-cdn-cf.behance.net/project_modules/1400/f3fcf9215461221.676d3d1f47a50.png","localImagePath":"/Users/gaganarora/Desktop/projects/motiacreative-development/reference-cache/images/dcac487da1251ada376bc25553497d8e587032e4.png","headline":"Sneaker Photo Composites | Shoe Manipulation","description":"Award-winning FOOTWEAR project from Behance","source":{"sourceName":"Behance","sourceUrl":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/215461221/Sneaker-Photo-Composites-Shoe-Manipulation?tracking_source=search_projects|FOOTWEAR+product+photography&l=3","publishedAt":"2025","awards":["500+ Behance Appreciations"]},"promptSummary":"Hero sneaker, oversized scale, placed on a rocky riverbed with a calm reflective pool, moody overcast alpine forest and distant mountain. Low ground-level wide shot, soft diffused sky light, crisp shoe with gentle background falloff, cool-neutral color grade with subtle vignette and natural shadow/reflection.","sceneComposition":{"camera":{"angleHeight":"Low, 20–40 cm off ground; 3/4 view of lateral side of shoe; slight upward tilt to exaggerate scale.","focalLength":"28–35mm (full-frame) wide-normal to include environment and reflection.","aperture":"f/5.6–f/8 to keep the shoe tack sharp and soften background slightly.","shutterISO":"1/125–1/250 sec at ISO 100–200 (sync speed if using strobe).","framing":"Shoe occupies ~50% of frame; reflection fills lower third; horizon/treeline around lower-middle of frame.","focus":"Single-point focus on the shoe’s front quarter; micro-adjust to keep logo and textures sharp."},"lighting":{"base":"Natural overcast sky acting as a giant softbox; soft, shadowless top light.","keyFill":"Optional 1 large softbox or umbrella above-left mimicking sky (~6000–6500K); white bounce from right for gentle fill; black flag/negative fill under medial side to keep form.","accents":"Subtle rim from sky edges; ensure soft contact shadow under sole aligned with ambient light direction.","modifiers":"Circular polarizer to control water glare and deepen foliage; keep some reflection visible."},"foreground":["Soft-focus grass tufts and small wet stones at frame bottom for depth.","Leading line into reflective pool; slight blur to push attention to shoe."],"midground":["Hero sneaker resting on textured rocky riverbed.","Clean, mirrorlike puddle directly beneath for reflection; minimal ripples."],"background":["Dense pine treeline across frame.","Distant mountain partially veiled by atmospheric haze.","Heavy, layered gray clouds for drama; cool, subdued palette."],"props":["Varied river stones (matte/wet).","Shallow still-water pool for reflection.","Sparse grass clumps; optional light mist for depth."],"postProcessing":["Composite the shoe onto plate: match perspective and scale; paint soft contact shadow and ambient occlusion.","Create reflection: duplicate, vertical flip, warp to water plane, lower opacity, add blur/ripple mask and slight darkening.","Color match: neutral-cool grade; slightly desaturate greens; keep shoe whites clean but not clipped.","Dodge & burn to sculpt panels, vents, and edges; enhance micro-contrast on shoe only.","Add atmospheric perspective to treeline/mountain; subtle vignette to center weight.","Edge cleanup/decontamination and ground interaction (wet speckling if needed).","Uniform grain/noise to blend elements; optional chromatic aberration/fringing at frame edges."],"emotion":["Epic and aspirational.","Calm confidence with outdoor performance credibility.","Premium craftsmanship meeting rugged nature."]}},{"id":"Behance-4915946789bf","imageUrl":"https://mir-s3-cdn-cf.behance.net/project_modules/disp_webp/1df740236023599.68e3e7d187072.jpg","localImagePath":"/Users/gaganarora/Desktop/projects/motiacreative-development/reference-cache/images/4915946789bf90a048e5dee8bf0efd32cce5af58.jpeg","headline":"SOCIAL MEDIA DESI