ricing and logistics.","Real-time community and coaching integration on PDPs (live reviews from similar runners, terrain-based recommendations).","Try-before-you-buy and multi-size/home fit-kits optimized for shoes to reduce returns and improve fit confidence."],"differentiationOpportunities":["Launch a universal Fit Passport: smartphone 3D foot scan + run gait inputs that auto-recommend size/width/last across all Nike models and remember preferences across devices and retail.","Scale a circular commerce program (trade-in credits, refurbished outlets online, and certified pre-owned) with clear quality tiers and warranty.","Offer build-to-order colorways on core franchises with 72-hour fulfillment windows, leveraging regionalized manufacturing to reduce waste.","Create a service ecosystem (cleaning, repair, outsole/midsole refresh) bundled with membership tiers and extended warranties.","Integrate real training data (from Nike Run Club and wearables) to dynamically recommend rotation lineups (daily trainer, speed, race, trail) on PDPs.","Expand adaptive and orthotic-compatible footwear with modular support kits and coaching for return-to-run or injury-prone athletes.","Increase transparency with product-level impact labels and allow filters for sustainability attributes (recycled content, repairability).","Localize drops and merchandising by climate/terrain and community runs, with geo-targeted inventory and same/next-day delivery windows.","Introduce a try-at-home sizing kit or multi-size shipment option for key launches to reduce returns and increase conversion.","Deepen women-first product and content (cycle-informed training plans, fit-tuned lasts, bra/shoe pairing guidance) presented as default in women’s journeys."],"industryTrends":["Minimalist, mobile-first product pages with oversized imagery, video loops, and sticky tech specs.","High-frequency limited drops and collaborations to drive urgency and social buzz.","Lifestyle-performance blur: everyday wearabil